# Where data lives (notes/AGENT_PLAYBOOK_2.md C7: four homes, and only results/ is for people). The ONE place these
# paths are defined: shell reads it through pbs/lib/homes.sh, Python through sweeps/homes.py.
#   primary       what runs and evaluations produce          MSDELTA_RUNS (training runs), MSDELTA_EVAL, MSDELTA_DIAG
#   preprocessed  datasets as the code consumes them         $MSDELTA_STORAGE/{data,eval-data,baselines/*/prepared}
#   derived       machine-readable data computed afterwards  MSDELTA_DERIVED/<name>/  (rebuildable, never hand-edited)
#   results       Markdown + plots for people, in the repo   results/<report>/        (no JSON / CSV / logs)
MSDELTA_STORAGE=/lus/flare/projects/UIC-HPC/khuss/msdelta
MSDELTA_RUNS=$MSDELTA_STORAGE/runs
MSDELTA_EVAL=$MSDELTA_STORAGE/eval
MSDELTA_DIAG=$MSDELTA_STORAGE/diag
MSDELTA_DERIVED=$MSDELTA_STORAGE/_derived
